            "line_count": 6,
            "preview": "// Start the builder with \"A\", then join varargs \"B\" and \"C\" directly into it. // join(StringBuilder, T...) wraps any IOException internally, so no checked exception is thrown. final StringBuilder sbuilder = new StringBuilder(\"A\");"
